full-query: "Your team starts to maintain a new application in AWS that uses a blue/green deployment. All these AWS services are deployed in a CloudFormation stack. The application has an ELB and two Auto Scaling Groups for the current release and the new release. After the new ASG is attached to the ELB, there are tests to ensure that the new code has run smoothly. However, there are possibilities that the tests have failed. You need to use a script to implement this blue/green deployment. Which of the below options would you consider to recover the system when the tests fail?"
